 const briefing=convoy?'Two independent allied economies escort three sequential two-truck convoys. Choose the northern or southern route at each checkpoint. Either commander can Hold; after a manual hold both must approve Advance. The visible countdown protects route decisions. A completed convoy unlocks one forward repair position for each owner, not free combat reinforcements. At least one truck from each convoy must arrive.':'Your HQs start on opposite sides of the river. Each commander must keep an HQ alive. Reopen the central connection, then neutralize the command and production structures of both hostile bases. Warned finite detachments enter the northwestern and northeastern roads. Each economy, service slot and army remains owned by its commander.';
